{
  "title": "Juicy Spiced Turkish Turkey Stir-fry",
  "description": "This sweet and juicy dish features panang curry paste in a braise that combines various spices for an adventurous take on traditional Turkish cuisine. It is prepared to be paleo-friendly.",
  "cuisine": "Turkish",
  "diet": [
